{"id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-boolalg.md","title":"Boolean Algebra","display":"df-boolalg — Boolean Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-boolalg","aliases":["93-df-boolalg"],"display":"df-boolalg — Boolean Algebra","depends_on":["[[93-df-distributive]]","[[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]]","[[93-df-similarity-type]]","[[93-df-algebra]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-boolalg"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-boolalg</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolalg — Boolean Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ba4d7ca4d35e9c4d\" href=\"?note=ba4d7ca4d35e9c4d\" title=\"93-df-distributive\">93-df-distributive</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0454a0272a142daa\" href=\"?note=0454a0272a142daa\" title=\"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice\">93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" href=\"?note=ee84ed8b0fae5bc3\" title=\"93-df-similarity-type\">93-df-similarity-type</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6730349967b8ffce\" href=\"?note=6730349967b8ffce\" title=\"93-df-algebra\">93-df-algebra</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B\">\\(\\mathbf B\\)</span> is a Boolean-algebra candidate with prospective carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> and basic operations <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge^{\\mathbf B},\\vee^{\\mathbf B},\\neg^{\\mathbf B},0^{\\mathbf B},1^{\\mathbf B}\">\\(\\wedge^{\\mathbf B},\\vee^{\\mathbf B},\\neg^{\\mathbf B},0^{\\mathbf B},1^{\\mathbf B}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\">\\(\\mathrm{SimilarityType}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DistLat}\">\\(\\mathrm{DistLat}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}\\)</span> are sourced from the cited definitions.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathsf{BA}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{BA}},\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}},\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}\">\\(S_{\\mathsf{BA}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{BA}},\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}},\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OneVal}_{93}\">\\(\\operatorname{OneVal}_{93}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B^-\">\\(\\mathbf B^-\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B^{01}\">\\(\\mathbf B^{01}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolAlg}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolAlg}\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\">\\(\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\)</span> 是固定且两两不同的运算符号；它们在所有引用本签名的文件中保持同一符号身份。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf B^-,\\mathbf B^{01},\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B),\\operatorname{OneVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\mathbf B^-,\\mathbf B^{01},\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B),\\operatorname{OneVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\)</span> 的构造定义域为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}}(\\mathbf B)\">\\(\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}}(\\mathbf B)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolalg}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathsf{BA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf{BA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle \\wedge,2\\rangle,\\langle \\vee,2\\rangle,\\langle \\neg,1\\rangle,\\langle 0,0\\rangle,\\langle 1,0\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S_{\\mathsf{BA}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolalg}\\vdash\nS_{\\mathsf{BA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\},\\\\\n\\alpha_{\\mathsf{BA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{\\langle \\wedge,2\\rangle,\\langle \\vee,2\\rangle,\\langle \\neg,1\\rangle,\\langle 0,0\\rangle,\\langle 1,0\\rangle\\},\\\\\n\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}&amp;\\coloneqq\\langle S_{\\mathsf{BA}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\rangle.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolalg}\\vdash\\mathbf B^-\\coloneqq\\langle|\\mathbf B|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf B},\\vee^{\\mathbf B}\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolalg}\\vdash\\mathbf B^-\\coloneqq\\langle|\\mathbf B|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf B},\\vee^{\\mathbf B}\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolalg}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(0;\\mathbf B),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{OneVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(1;\\mathbf B)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolalg}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(0;\\mathbf B),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{OneVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{NullVal}_{93}(1;\\mathbf B)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolalg}\\vdash\n\\mathbf B^{01}\\coloneqq\n\\langle|\\mathbf B|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf B},\\vee^{\\mathbf B},\n\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B),\\operatorname{OneVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\rangle\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolalg}\\vdash\n\\mathbf B^{01}\\coloneqq\n\\langle|\\mathbf B|,\\wedge^{\\mathbf B},\\vee^{\\mathbf B},\n\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B),\\operatorname{OneVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\rangle\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolalg}\\vdash\\mathbf B\\in\\mathrm{BoolAlg}\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathbf B^-\\in\\mathrm{DistLat}\n\\land\\forall a\\in|\\mathbf B|\\;\\Bigl(\na\\wedge^{\\mathbf B}\\neg^{\\mathbf B}(\\langle a\\rangle)=\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land a\\vee^{\\mathbf B}\\neg^{\\mathbf B}(\\langle a\\rangle)=\\operatorname{OneVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolalg}\\vdash\\mathbf B\\in\\mathrm{BoolAlg}\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Alg}_{\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}}(\\mathbf B)\\land\\mathbf B^-\\in\\mathrm{DistLat}\n\\land\\forall a\\in|\\mathbf B|\\;\\Bigl(\na\\wedge^{\\mathbf B}\\neg^{\\mathbf B}(\\langle a\\rangle)=\\operatorname{ZeroVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\n\\land a\\vee^{\\mathbf B}\\neg^{\\mathbf B}(\\langle a\\rangle)=\\operatorname{OneVal}_{93}(\\mathbf B)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolalg}\\vdash\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_{\\mathsf{BA}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{BA}})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolalg}\\vdash\\mathrm{SimilarityType}(S_{\\mathsf{BA}},\\alpha_{\\mathsf{BA}})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolalg}\\vdash\n\\mathbf B\\in\\mathrm{BoolAlg}\\to\n\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}(\\mathbf B^{01})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}boolalg}\\vdash\n\\mathbf B\\in\\mathrm{BoolAlg}\\to\n\\mathrm{BoundedDistLat}_{93}(\\mathbf B^{01})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The Boolean similarity type is a sourced object used by products, powers, polynomial operations, and algebraic semantics. The nullary operation graphs are evaluated at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span> before their values enter the bounded-lattice reduct or complement laws.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-distributive","status":"resolved","id":"ba4d7ca4d35e9c4d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-distributive]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice","status":"resolved","id":"0454a0272a142daa","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-bounded-distributive-lattice]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-similarity-type","status":"resolved","id":"ee84ed8b0fae5bc3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-similar